=== CHANGES ===
Files modified:
  - .github/ARCHITECTURE.md (ADR-007): replaced the legacy Freshness/RULES
    block with the new live-read policy. Added subsections:
      * Live-read merge rule (per signal): newer non-zero Timestamp wins;
        ties prefer L2; legacy zero-Timestamp loses to any non-zero
        Timestamp on either side; both-zero L1 wins.
      * Freshness is informational, not a filter: GetSignal/GetAll return
        the full union of L1 and L2; IsLiveSignalFresh exposes age and
        legacy unknown-freshness as advisory metadata; the boundary does
        NOT silently drop stale or zero-Timestamp values.
      * signal_log last-known-value fallback (current-state reads):
        BuildStateFromSignalStore consults signal_log SnapshotAt(now) ONLY
        for fields the live store left at Go zero/empty; live values always
        win; this is a signal_log read, not a snapshot-table read, and is
        consistent with ADR-001.
      * Warm-time legacy restamp (self-heal on hydration): Warm calls
        RedisSignalCache.RestampLegacy before hydrating L1; restamp is
        idempotent, value-preserving, refreshes the key TTL, never deletes
        fields, and surfaces partial-failure errors WITHOUT mutating L1.
      * RULES updated to add positive bullets for the merge rule, the
        freshness-as-info contract, the signal_log fallback, and the Warm
        restamp self-heal; added negative bullets forbidding silent drops
        at the boundary and forbidding HDEL/DEL/field deletion in restamp.
